WEBVTT

NOTE The teammate exchanged rise and run. English captions.

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.726
Starting at zero, six is correct.

2
00:00:04.276 --> 00:00:07.151
A teammate moves right
three and down four.

3
00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:11.012
That gives slope negative four-thirds:

4
00:00:11.012 --> 00:00:14.312
vertical change divided
by horizontal change.

5
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:18.345
Our equation needs right
four and down three.

6
00:00:18.995 --> 00:00:20.663
Exchange the changes.

7
00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:25.527
The incorrect drawing predicts
arrival at four and a half seconds;

8
00:00:25.527 --> 00:00:27.864
the correct graph predicts eight.

9
00:00:28.614 --> 00:00:32.740
These are graph predictions, not
changes to the actual motion.
